// Footnote citations and the list of endnotes they point at.

--- footnote ---
Text.#footnote[A note.]
│ <p>Text.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1">A note. <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>

--- footnote-two ---
One.#footnote[First note.] Two.#footnote[Second note.]
│ <p>One.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup> Two.<sup id="fnref:2"><a href="#fn:2">2</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1">First note. <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ <li id="fn:2">Second note. <a href="#fnref:2" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>

--- footnote-with-two-paragraphs ---
// A footnote body is a block context, so paragraphs form in it.
Text.#footnote[One paragraph.

And another.]
│ <p>Text.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1"><p>One paragraph.</p>
│ <p>And another.</p>
│ <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>

--- footnote-with-markup ---
Text.#footnote[A *bold* note.]
│ <p>Text.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1">A <strong>bold</strong> note. <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>

--- footnote-cited-twice ---
// A reference to a footnote repeats its number rather than making a new one.
Text.#footnote[A note.] <note>

Again.@note
│ <p>Text.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <p>Again.<sup><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1">A note. <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>

--- footnote-with-list ---
Text.#footnote[
- apples
- pears
]
│ <p>Text.<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1">1</a></sup></p>
│ <div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
│ <hr>
│ <ol>
│ <li id="fn:1"><ul>
│ <li>apples</li>
│ <li>pears</li>
│ </ul>
│ <a href="#fnref:1" role="doc-backlink">&#8617;</a></li>
│ </ol>
│ </div>
